this package contains all secrets to be managed across my systems, encrypted. it also contains a .sops.yaml TEMPLATED file because it needs to remain on a relative path (its absolute path will be its nix store path)

it must also build a nix expression generated from the yaml file, which can be passed to thatWaterCharmander to automatically generate the `sops.secrets` attribute of the NixOS module that will provide the secrets systemwide

then, the wranHearst NixOS module (or any hardware-bound NixOS module) specifies an absolute non-store path containing the age key necessary to decrypt secrets

